{"unit_id": "tag:01VN:proof", "translation": "按定义，存在一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0001>-模（module）<MATH_0002>和一个浸入（immersion）<MATH_0003>（在<MATH_0004>上），使得<MATH_0005>。\n令<MATH_0006>，则按定义有<MATH_0007>。\n分次（graded）<MATH_0008>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0009>带有映射（map）<MATH_0010>，其中第二个箭头（arrow）用到了等同（identification）<MATH_0011>。\n由<MATH_0012>与<MATH_0013>的伴随性（adjointness），得到一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>。\n我们略去验证态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>（与此映射（map）相联系）恰为浸入（immersion）<MATH_0016>这一步。\n因此，由引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>的第（6）部分即得结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰所取的模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "在给定环层上的模"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "给定基底上的浸入"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰所构造的代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "在给定环层上的分次代数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "分次代数所带的映射"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头", "context": "所给映射表达式中的第二个箭头"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同", "context": "第二个箭头用到的等同"}, {"source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性", "context": "用于得到态射的伴随关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由伴随性得到的